[h1]Dear customers![/h1]

We know that you didn't hear from us for a while, but there is a reason for it. We're developing the next huge update for Let's Bowl VR. We know that some of you prefer small and often updates, but we're working on some complex features that are very dependent and it would be better for everyone to release them pretty well polished and tested. Especially the multiplayer feature.

I do not want this to sound like an excuse, but as you may know, we're indie developers and our game still in Early Access. We're working without any investments in our free time and our dream is to make a very special bowling game suitable for everyone from professional bowlers to casual gamers. How you can see we're working very close with the community and we implemented a lot of features by your requests and we're going to continue this practice.

We can't wait to share all the stuff we're working on with you, but everything has its time. So to break the silence and to make you sure that this project is more than alive, we decided to release the list of features that will be released in upcoming quarter:

1. Multiplayer mode;
2. Oil coating (was planned to release in PATCH 003, but it was disabled due to some issue);
3. Inventory and stuff;
4. Different weight of balls (currently all balls have the same weight - 13 lbs);
5. Major physics improvements;
6. Challenges game mode (in its final state and unlocked regardless of career);
7. Career walkthrough fixes and improvements;
8. AI: The girl will finally play with you;
9. New Lobby map;
10. Finally you will be able to throw the [strike]annoying[/strike] tablet away and play with free hands;
11. Lots of bug fixes and improvements;

Please stay tuned and thank you very much for your patience!

[i]Sincerely yours,
«Let's Bowl VR» development team![/i]

